summary: 'First v7.x fast-follow: the standalone CLI orchestrator now closes the learning loop too (v7.0 scoped it to MCP-world). New #task-bridge adapter (packages/paradigm/src/core/task-bridge.ts) mints an epic + per-stage task DAG at run start and calls completeTask as stages finish, triggering settlement + the chainLive chain exactly as the MCP path. Wired into both the solo and DAG orchestration paths; best-effort isolation. Reuses task-loader primitives via the established relative-import precedent (core/habits/evaluator.ts), not the MCP-coupled emitTaskDag. Build clean; CLI 387→396, MCP unchanged 373.'
